      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Standart or Diffuse shader looks black only if creator of the world didnt set up ambient lght properly (light probes, baking, ...).\n\nFlat Lit is a bad idea because not every avatar is anime/carton styled, so it will look even more incorect on other avatars.\n\nI didn't tested cutout yet, but my guess is it's not working if original shader did not set replacment tag ( https://docs.unity3d.com/560/Documentation/Manual/SL-ShaderReplacement.html )  properly so unity don't know on which type of shader it should be replaced.\n\nCorrect solution can be replacement hints: https://vrchat.canny.io/trust-and-safety-system/p/632-ability-for-creators-to-make-hints-for-shader-replacement",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
