      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{59b80cbbd1662e660835c7c5|full_name}: Why are the toon shaders not on some kind of 'whitelist' of shaders? Assuming the point behind the safety system is to ensure someone doesn't abuse shaders, would a whitelist of known shaders not make sense?",
